        <item>
            <title>0.1.8-beta</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 10:37:59 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://typoless.app</link>
            <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
            <sparkle:version>113</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.8-beta</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Models</h3>
<ul>
    <li>The downloaded model is now Gemma 4 E2B, in place of Gemma 4 E4B. It is 1.5 GB smaller, about three times faster, and corrects better in every language that was measured: 80% of English messages exactly right against 43%, and 79 to 81% in Spanish, French, Italian, Dutch and Portuguese. The larger model found slightly more errors and then changed text that was already right, which is the one thing this app is meant not to do.</li>
    <li>Each model now says what it is worth beside what it costs, so a smaller download is no longer the only thing you have to go on.</li>
    <li>The advice beside each language follows the new measurements. The downloaded model measures best in five of the seven languages now. English and German stay with the built-in model.</li>
    <li>If you had Gemma 4 E4B selected, Typoless uses the new model and downloads it the first time you correct something. The old weights stay in <code>~/.cache/huggingface</code> until you remove them.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
